Output docs/profile.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 820
Set Padding 18
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH PS1='$ ' && cd examples/cnn_images && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "train-doctor profile --profiler-steps 0 -- python train.py"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 22s
Sleep 6s
